Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 00:35:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] WIP: F-219 - deaths.py breakdown; engage pack radius 25 yd +
 rest/mana first; rest spots out to 80 yd

From the hunter/priest/mage cause-of-death breakdown (2026-10-31 run):
- engage: another hostile within 25 yd (was 18) makes it a pack - engaged mobs brought their
  neighbour and the second one killed the bot at full health
- engage: rest first when below 70 % HP or 60 % mana (mana classes)
- step_clear: look at 55/80 yd rings when nothing within 35 yd is outside every reach (the priest
  rested "-13 yd outside" reach inside the vineyard camp and died to 5)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019SSuH6gpqY4Kn5Rk9sd149
